dhṛṣṭadyumno virāṭaś ca
sātyakiś cāparājitaḥ\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":282,\"bb\":261,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/16-18/b261/\",\"body_value\":\"drupado draupadeyāś ca
